  "implementation": [
    "PP1 borrows existing target embedding/head objects, including custom implementations.",
    "For PP>1/DP1, gather native unquantized source metadata, validate the PP/TP layout and source shards, allocate missing replicas, then broadcast the matching TP shards from first/last PP owners.",
    "Fence source and replica allocation/layout errors across all ranks before any device collective.",
    "Keep owner object identity and leave other target stages' missing modules untouched. Only draft replicas attach the returned modules.",
    "Draft construction has runner-local PP1/rank0 while retaining TP state and the published immutable ServerArgs object.",
    "BaseRunner graph dimensions and dummy PP proxy selection use model_runner.ps.pp_size.",
    "DraftBlockProposer embeds through the attached draft module, which is present on non-first PP stages.",
    "No scheduler loop, capability gate, Mooncake API or snapshot format changed."
  ],
